                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7841fac-1ce5-4d43-8a0b-81148796ce7c",
                                "sense_id": "2153b1ea-9c8c-3e2a-8de3-6d320a71a502",
                                "text": "Всё в нём дыша́ло счастли́вою весёлостью здоро́вья, дыша́ло мо́лодостью — беспе́чностью, самонаде́янностью, избало́ванностью, пре́лестью мо́лодости.",
                                "translation": "Everything about him was suggestive of the happy light-heartedness of perfect health and youth—the carelessness, conceit, self-indulgence, and charm of youth.",
                                "english": "Everything about him was suggestive of the happy light-heartedness of perfect health and youth—the carelessness, conceit, self-indulgence, and charm of youth."
